    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d593">

                <pb facs="0826" n="720" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg720"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Governor Sir W. MacGregor to the Earl of
                    Elgin.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Downing Street</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-08-17"><hi rendition="#italic">August 17,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 11.]</seg></opener>
                <p>Referring to your telegram of the 16th August, please send brief summary of your
                    ministers’ reply to me by telegraph.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
